{"name":"Incubi Darkness","hex":"#0b474a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"incubi","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of incubus"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/incubi"},{"term":"darkness","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The state of being dark; lack of light; the absolute or comparative absence of light.","The state or quality of reflecting little light, of tending to a blackish or brownish color."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/darkness"}],"entries":[{"title":"Incubus","blocks":[{"text":"An incubus is a male demon who is described in various folklore as appearing in the dreams of female humans in order to seduce them. Repeated interactions between an incubus and a woman will lead to sexual activity, a bond forming between them, and ultimately sexual intercourse, as he requires vaginal ejaculation discharge to survive. The establishment and perpetuation of such a relationship enables the production of a hybrid child known as a cambion, but at the expense of the woman, whose mental and physical health will deteriorate rapidly, eventually resulting in her death if the incubus continues courting her for a protracted period."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Incubus.jpg/330px-Incubus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Incubus","wikidata":"Q378070"},{"title":"Darkness","blocks":[{"text":"Darkness is the condition resulting from a lack of illumination, or an absence of visible light."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Creation_of_Light.png/330px-Creation_of_Light.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darkness","wikidata":"Q204170"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/The_Calling_of_Saint_Matthew-Caravaggo_%281599-1600%29.jpg